  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuvalu Individual Short Term Training Scholarships Allocations for 24-27 Triennium</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to increase the knowledge and skills of individuals so that they can contribute to the development of Tuvalu, and to positively impact the bilateral relationship by providing short term scholarships (for no less than one week up to a maximum of 12 months in length) to scholars from Tuvalu. These short-term scholarships can take the form of vocational training, an apprenticeship, or other workplace experience.</narrative>
  </description>
